   1521  fc61		       18		      clc
   1522  fc62		       60		      rts
   1523  fc63
   1524  fc63							; Shared body: X = direction (0 up, 1 down, 2 left, 3 right).
   1525  fc63							; Stages FetchPtr = level base + n (RoomPositions, C2 2026-10-20: the room
   1526  fc63							; record is 3 B spread over three columns, so the position column still starts
   1527  fc63							; one block-of-n in), reads this room's own position, steps it by the
